  <description>
    <p>
      UltimaVLESS is an open-source desktop client for VLESS servers, built on Xray-core.
      It supports Reality and Vision, subscriptions, a system proxy mode and a TUN mode
      that routes all traffic of the system through the VPN.
    </p>
